-- Vegetarian restaurants for the map (task sheet US15).
-- Upserts by id on every start: editing a row here updates the database on the next start.
-- Removing a row here does NOT delete it from the database.
-- LocationServiceIntegrationTests pins distances from Ben Thanh market to these rows.
-- image_url is a photo of the restaurant hotlinked from where it was found (its own site, review sites,
-- Google Images thumbnails), so the FE must fall back to its default image when one stops loading.
-- Rows without a usable photo of their own (49, 57, 91-100) use an illustrative photo from Cloudinary
-- folder veggiepal/restaurants, picked by the kind of restaurant in the name: lau, buffet, cafe,
-- street-food, com-chay-{id % 2 + 1}, restaurant-{id % 4 + 1}.
